        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "When work is carried on in two or more shifts, the second and third shifts shall receive eight hours' pay for seven and one-half hours' work at the regular rate. This rule shall also apply to any Employer who finds it necessary to work only a night shift. No man shall work on more than one shift unless the man or men engaged for such work fail to report for work. This does not apply to cupola lining, retort or conduit work.",
            "block_bbox": [
